From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:36:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] phy: qcom: qmp-ufs: add SM8350

The SM8350 tables are already here for sa8775p, whose configuration is
SM8350's (Linux sm8350_ufsphy_cfg): same tables, clocks and registers.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
---
 drivers/phy/qcom/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qcom/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c b/drivers/phy/qcom/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c
index 3df88189..67dc1e63 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qcom/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qcom/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c
@@ -1747,6 +1747,8 @@ static const struct udevice_id qmp_ufs_ids[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7150-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sm7150_ufsphy_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sm8150_ufsphy_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sm8250_ufsphy_cfg },
+	/* sa8775p's configuration is SM8350's: same tables, clocks and register layout */
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8350-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sa8775p_ufsphy_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,qcs8300-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sa8775p_ufsphy_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8550-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sm8550_ufsphy_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-qmp-ufs-phy", .data = (ulong)&sm8650_ufsphy_cfg },
-- 
